meta {
  name: listar - GET /api/horarios
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:8080
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/horarios?page=0&size=10
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Publico sin auth. POST requiere ?salaCodigo= y rol ADMIN o ADMINISTRADOR_TEATRO. Solape -> 400 con DOMAIN_SHOWING_BUSINESS_RULE_SCHEDULE_OVERLAP (contrato 4.0).
}
